# The feel checks a picture can show (docs/design/feel-f2.md), as a warrior
# on the feel yard: the F3 overlay and the yard (F1); the button's pulse,
# a refused press and a queued one; a heavy blow's tell; a stun's daze.
# Run by tools/feel/check.sh.

say /feel
wait 3
say /time noon
wait 1

# --- F1: the overlay on F3, and the yard -------------------------------------
key f3
wait 1.5
shot overlay
key f3
orbit 150
wait 1
shot yard-east
orbit -150
wait 1
shot yard-west
orbit 0

# --- the press and a stun: Onrush (key 2: rush in, stun 1.5 s, 20 rage) lights
# its key at once; Heroic Blow (key 1) pressed at once after is refused (the
# global cooldown has most of its time to run); pressed in its last moment it
# is queued, its key beating until it goes off; the stunned dummy is dazed
walk-to creature training_dummy 9
look-at creature training_dummy
click right creature training_dummy
key 2
shot press-lit
key 1
shot press-refused
orbit 40
shot daze-1
wait 0.3
shot daze-2
orbit 0
wait 0.55
key 1
shot press-queued
wait 1.5

# --- a heavy blow's tell: stand in its reach and let it strike three times ---
walk-to creature training_dummy 1.0
look-at creature training_dummy
orbit 40
wait 1.0
clip-start tell
wait 8.0
clip-end
orbit 0
